WEBVTT

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:06.630
A mysterious transfer student
appeared at Karasumori Academy.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:13.940
His powers, charged with Negative Energy,
overwhelm Yoshimori.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.510
I'm Shishio Gen from the Night Troops,
Special Forces of the Shadow Organization.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.680
Dispatched to provide security

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.350
to the Karasumori Site
and assist the Kekkaishi here.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.770
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.640
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.840
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.740
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.180
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.590
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.120
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.460
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:12.130
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.630
Sha la la la la...

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:23.040
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.010
(Secret romance)

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:30.220
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.980
(A strange distance)

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:38.830
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:39.890
Yeah

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.360
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.970
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:52.300
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.880
The Night Troops?
From that Shadow Organization?

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.920
Ha! Don't make me laugh!

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.400
You damn Ayakashi!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.300
Think you disguised yourself
pretty well as a human?

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.530
You can't fool me!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.760
You really don't know?

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.710
Ayakashi can't be active
during the day.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.510
Hello?

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.310
B-Bro!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.240
Oh? Is this Yoshimori?

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:42.080
Why are you calling
from Gen's cellphone?

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:45.430
Don't give me that!
Who is this guy?!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:46.780
Who?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.790
I told you I was sending
an assistant your way didn't I?

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.760
I didn't hear that!

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.430
So you're one of
Masamori's underlings?!

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.770
Why are the Night Troops
interfering with us?!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.500
A new kind of enemy is
after this land.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:06.610
They're different from the ones up to now,
they're an organized group of Ayakashi.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.020
You two won't be able
to handle them.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:10.340
That's why I'm here.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:14.840
With a Legitimate Heir
like you...

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.320
I may still have
a lot to work on...

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.930
but I'll be stronger
than him one day!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.750
Ketsu!

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.090
Stop causing a commotion at school

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.120
during the middle of the day!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.660
This is a fight between us men!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:29.970
Don't interfere!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.400
Shut up.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.070
You too.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:37.100
If you're with the Shadow Organization,
you should know better.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.150
What? Why did he look so scared?

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.790
It's because you're so violent.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.180
That boy is dangerous.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.520
Sorry but can we
do this another time?

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.320
When is that "time"
going to be?

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.560
Magnitude 2 going to 3.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.870
You're rarely awake at all,
and when you are, you're annoying.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:38.360
Hey, look!
Sumimura is awake for once.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.630
Maybe there's gonna be
an earthquake soon.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.770
A small one's happening right now.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.600
Tabata, do you know
that guy Shishio?

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.010
The transfer student next door, right?

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:51.150
There's some mystery
surrounding him.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.890
Mystery? Aren't you exaggerating a bit?

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:57.190
I hear that he lives alone.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:58.720
Doesn't that seem a bit suspicious?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.890
A junior high kid living alone?

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.490
I talked to his homeroom teacher

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:08.300
and got yelled at for sticking my nose
into other people's lives.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.300
So I think it's something like that.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:15.340
As always, you gather
useless information.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.410
You fool. Apparently,
that bad-boy look is popular

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.540
among the high school girls.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.880
- What?!
- Huh?!

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.050
That jerk!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:34.650
I have to settle things with him
once and for all!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.090
He already went home.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:38.790
He left school early.

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:42.130
He ran away! That coward!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.300
Um. Sumimura-kun...

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:46.330
What?!

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:50.000
It's about the transfer student.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.410
Don't talk about that guy!

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.140
O-Okay!

00:05:58.490 --> 00:05:59.580
I understand.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.820
But I didn't think they would
dispatch someone so young.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.920
I suppose you can move around
in the school

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.260
without raising suspicion
if you are a student.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.700
So have you found a place to stay?

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.900
Yes, they've rented out
an apartment for me nearby.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.760
Since it's just you,
you could have stayed here.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.280
No, I couldn't possibly impose.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.510
So that's the head of
the Yukimura family...

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.820
She's a very powerful Caster.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:36.690
Oh hello.
Are you Yoshimori's friend?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.360
Is the head of the family here?

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:40.550
Huh?

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:44.290
I am an emissary from
the Shadow Organization.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.650
The Shadow Organization!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:54.430
I'm sorry. I'll go look around
the neighborhood.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.440
So please have some tea
and sweets while you wait.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:03.980
Just the tea is enough for me.
I don't like sweet things.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:15.820
You never change.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.760
This room is as tasteless as ever.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:24.530
You're the one that never changes.
You said the same thing last time.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:32.540
Let me introduce you to
my assistant, Kagami-kun.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.830
That's an Ayakashi, isn't it?

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.360
Oh... As expected...

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.060
Fool. I can tell just by looking.

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:58.570
Not only that, making her look
like that woman you used to be in love with.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.470
In addition to having bad taste, you're a man
who just doesn't know when to give up.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.840
Unrequited love is always beautiful.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.980
In the end. all men are stubborn.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.610
You should know that
better than me.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.150
Pervert.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.150
Don't describe me in a single word.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:18.450
I have the perfect job for
a pervert like you.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.590
Don't call me "pervert" twice.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.230
It used to look like a human arm.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.230
This is a piece of it.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:35.370
Sounds interesting.
Let's hear the details.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.210
Ayakashi wearing human skin, I see.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:46.280
It's amazing that they even
fooled the demon dogs.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:47.650
How nice...

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:50.380
They can do whatever
they want inside Karasumori

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:51.910
without you finding out.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.220
If it were up to me,

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.560
I'd definitely go during the day
when there are lots of people around.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.200
You really are a crooked man.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:03.130
And who's the one asking
the crooked man for help?

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.770
You want me to look into this, right?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.410
But this is only a part of it.

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:13.670
Bring all of it.
We'll talk then.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.020
Don't hold back on me.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:18.880
I will look into it for you.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:20.480
Tell me the date and time
you obtained it,

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.610
the situation. and the characteristics
of the Ayakashi.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.020
Tell me everything.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.060
And don't give that information
to anyone but me.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.960
You're so greedy.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.000
Who's the one being greedy?

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.390
You intend on not
paying me again, right?

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:38.030
Oh! Then how about you let me
conduct some on-site research

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.230
on Karasumori instead?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.170
No. I'm not going to let
a pervert like you

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.110
defile the Karasumori Site.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.680
Your dedication to Karasumori
never wanes.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.740
Well, I don't mind either way.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.690
I can just refuse to help you,
you know.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.780
Fine. I'll give you
the information you want.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.420
But not now.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.490
I have to speak to my grandson.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.960
He fought the Ayakashi.

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.860
Your grandson?
You mean Yoshimori-kun?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:11.100
Then I should talk to him directly.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.270
What? You're hesitant on that too?

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.740
Have you already entrusted
all the duties to him?

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:21.820
Yoshimori-kun's still in junior high, right?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:24.840
It's none of your concern.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:28.550
That fool still has a lot to learn.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:29.850
but he's good in combat.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:37.150
Is Shuji-kun doing well?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.320
Yeah.

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:41.500
Heisuke, I've told you
this many times,

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:42.900
but Shuji-san is now
a member of Sumimura Family.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:45.240
It's not what you think.
I was only asking.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:50.340
Like me, he was very interested
in supernatural things

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:52.570
and he was a very capable assistant.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.770
But Shuji-kun was a bit too kind
to be involved

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.480
with someone like me.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.250
He's not with his friends and

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:04.950
he's not at
the Senior Citizens Club either...

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:09.090
Where else could he be?

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:14.060
No... It can't be.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:31.210
So this is where he was born...

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.440
I'LL BE AT KONTA'S... - TOSHIMORI.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.010
YOSHIMORI ASLEEP

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.180
I'm home.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.190
I'm hungry...

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.750
Awesome, sweets!

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.160
Sh-Shishio!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:19.490
You! What are you doing here?!

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.270
You got some nerve

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:26.800
robbing my home in
broad daylight.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:29.470
A false accusation.

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.710
Sorry I kept you waiting,
Shishio-kun.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:35.100
Oh, you're back, Yoshimori?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.390
Don't give me that!
What is he doing here?!

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.120
What do you mean?

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.990
I'm sorry. I'll just come back
another time.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:49.490
Shishio-kun, why don't you stay
and have dinner?

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.990
I couldn't...

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.330
Of course, you couldn't!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.340
Get out of here! You're not welcome here!
We don't have food for you to eat!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.800
Yoshimori!

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:01.930
How could you say that
to your friend!

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.600
H-He's not... my friend...

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:07.370
What's with the ruckus?

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.520
Father! Where were you all this time?

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:11.540
You have a visitor.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.740
A visitor?

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.220
A visitor for Grandpa Shige?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.100
So how much does
the Shadow Organization know

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:27.430
about the enemy?

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.360
How are you going to move
against them?

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.600
I don't have the authority
to know that sort of information.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:34.900
So I can't answer.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.200
I don't like it one bit.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:41.440
The Karasumori Site
has been entrusted to us.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.580
We are put in a difficult position

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.780
when decisions are made without
consulting us first.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.220
I will let it go this time,

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.020
but tell your superiors
what I just said.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:55.450
Do you understand?

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:57.350
Yes.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:01.730
But I'm here on the orders
of your grandson.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.410
I made so much food...

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:09.230
I wonder why Shishio-kun had
to go home?

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:15.510
Yoshimori, you have to properly
invite him next time.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.850
No way!

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.780
Hello?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:55.820
It's me. Do you have
some time right now?

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:58.260
Yes, it's okay.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:01.250
So how is it? Are you getting
along with Yoshimori?

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:04.460
He doesn't amount to much.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:06.360
Don't say that.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.430
That's my little brother
you're talking about.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.130
I know it's a mission.
but don't push yourself too hard.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.270
There are a lot of people
at the school.

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.540
Just enjoy campus life, you know?

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.070
I'm not...

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:23.240
You should start learning
how to talk to girls...

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.310
Wha-?

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.610
Tokine is a really nice girl.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.220
You should try to
get along with her too.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:34.680
B-But they're so noisy
and immature. And...

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:35.720
And?

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:39.100
I feel like I might
break them someday.

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:44.360
Gen... I know you can control
your powers now.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.030
- Right?
- Umm... Chief...

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.700
What?

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:54.610
Give it back...
Give me my arm back!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.580
Sorry, I can't hear you too well.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:57.610
Hello?

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:02.650
Sorry, can you speak up a bit?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.890
My arm...

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.990
I'll never forgive you.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.230
Um... Can I ask
you one thing?

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.530
Go ahead.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.330
Um... Why...

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.140
I guess this isn't a good place.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.040
Huh?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.870
No, I think the reception
is bad here.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.740
Chief?

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.720
So. where were we?

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:46.330
Why did you send me here?

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:52.140
Oh... well...

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:59.140
I actually have lots of reasons.

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:03.250
But I thought that you'd get along
with Yoshimori.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:13.120
You know, you should stop
drowning your worries

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.460
with all that coffee milk.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.960
Shut up! How can I not drink
with how things are?!

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.160
Damn that Shishio!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.360
He's just some grunt from
the Night Troops.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.430
Don't get all worked up.

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.530
He's the one picking
a fight with me!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.540
Calm down.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.440
It's true that Masamori
is stronger than you.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.240
He's more skillful and
versatile with techniques...

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.110
Madarao, are you trying to
pick a fight with me too?

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.410
Taking Masamori's side...

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:43.520
What? Let me tell you that
I hate that beard-faced baldie.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.290
I made up my mind!
I'm going to chase him out!

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.360
Tokine!

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.360
Let's chase him out!

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.240
What are you talking about?!

00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:58.930
I'm talking about Shishio!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.670
Let's chase him out of here!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.170
He's not going to cooperate
with us!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.270
But we haven't really talked
to him yet.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.650
What are we going
to talk about?!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.910
Grandpa Shige said that
the Shadow Organization

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.010
has no intention
of sharing information with us!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:14.940
I'm not talking about
the Shadow Organization.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:19.250
It's Gen. We don't know
anything about him yet.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:22.530
I don't want to know anything
about that violent jerk!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.130
But you know,
I can't leave him alone.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.660
There's just something
about him.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.200
You can't leave him alone?
What are you saying?

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.670
It's better if everyone
just left him alone!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.330
Are you insane?

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.610
An Ayakashi's here.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.510
This one's a big one.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.020
Bring it on!

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.950
Let's prove it to Shishio that we don't
need any help from him.

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:46.980
Hey!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.610
Yoshimori! Let's go!

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.450
Yoshi seems to be pumped up.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.520
A bit too much!

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:54.820
I just hope he doesn't trip
on the way.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.490
Is it really near here?

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.300
Yeah, there's a sketchy smell
hanging around.

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:04.300
You better be careful.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.610
Yoshimori, hurry up!

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:13.940
Geez!

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.610
Be careful. It's really fast.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.890
It's huge, and quick!

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:31.890
Ketsu!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.370
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:36.200
Damn it!

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.430
Calm down!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.230
Ketsu!

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:45.500
Ketsu!

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:50.250
How about this?!

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:56.310
Nenshi!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.410
I got it!

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:01.020
Yoshimori!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.960
What are you doing?
Cut the Nenshi!

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.630
Oh, right!

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:10.890
Yoshimori!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.070
Ow... Where is it?

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:15.910
It went towards the school.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:18.370
Damn!

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.350
What's going on?!
Such powerful Negative Energy!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.010
This feeling...

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:47.400
Both of you... are way too slow.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:51.070
Hey...

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:54.210
You're here to assist
us Kekkaishi, right?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:58.250
Then you shouldn't be doing
things without our permission.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:00.280
Kekkaishi. huh?

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:03.050
As far as I know,

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:06.080
Kekkaishi are the most powerful
Casters in existence.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.050
But you...

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:11.120
You're completely different.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:16.490
I'm sure the Ayakashi
after this land

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.160
would love to know
how weak you are.

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.570
I am so bored I could die.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:30.180
Please don't say that even
as a joke.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:34.310
Then take Karasumori right now.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.450
Another impossible request.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:40.550
You seem to be spreading rumors
about Karasumori.

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:42.420
What is your intention?

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:46.970
This is the best way
to test enemy forces

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.800
without taking casualties
of our own.

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:51.200
Now what will you do

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:53.760
if they took over Karasumori
before us?

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:56.930
Then we will just take it
from them.

00:21:58.180 --> 00:22:00.540
I don't like roundabout ways,

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:02.640
since I get bored.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.150
I'm sorry.

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:08.550
Byaku. I love fun things.
Do you understand?

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:09.610
Yes.

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:13.190
Then hurry up and entertain me.

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:17.720
I will present Karasumori to you,
and you will be entertained

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:21.260
to your heart's content, Princess.

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:52.560
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:56.970
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:01.270
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.700
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:18.190
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:26.930
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:31.760
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:40.370
Don't cry

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:49.120
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:53.950
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.990 --> 00:24:02.370
Don't cry
